# =============================================================================
# .gitignore for MIND / Einat paper R project
#
# Philosophy:
#   - Track CODE (.R, .Rmd, .md, .py, configs)
#   - Track DOCUMENTATION (README, handoffs, the HTML report if you want)
#   - Do NOT track DATA (raw or derived) — DUA-protected, large, sensitive
#   - Do NOT track OUTPUTS (results, plots, txt dumps) — regenerable by pipeline
#   - Do NOT track R session state (.RData, .Rhistory) — contains in-memory data
# =============================================================================

# ---- R session state (CRITICAL: contains last-session data in memory) -------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj.bak

# ---- R package management ---------------------------------------------------
renv/library/
renv/local/
renv/lock/
renv/python/
renv/staging/
.Rprofile

# ---- Data files (ALL of them, raw or derived) -------------------------------
*.rds
*.RDS
*.rda
*.Rdata
*.RData
*.feather
*.parquet
*.csv
*.tsv
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.sav
*.dta
*.sas7bdat

# ---- Specific data folders (defense in depth, even if extensions miss) ------
SPARK*/
SSC*/
ssc_*/
ANCAN*/
ancan*/
SEM_output/data/
SEM_output/data_with_iq/
SEM_output/missing/
SEM_output/plots/
correlation_matrices/plots/
correlation_matrices/*.rds
plots180225/
plots_new/
plots_new_1/
chars*/
descriptives_output/
mind_pres_*/
pdf2png/

# ---- Sex-split data files at root (from Fisher script) ----------------------
*_Boys.rds
*_Girls.rds
MIND_Preschool*
MIND_Schoolage*
SSC_Preschool*
SSC_Schoolage*

# ---- Output / generated artifacts (regenerable by pipeline) -----------------
*.png
*.pdf
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.svg
*.eps
*.tiff
*.html        # remove this line if you DO want to track HTML reports
SEM_results.txt
Fisher_rz_results.txt
regression_*.txt
regression_*.csv
regression_*.xlsx
section9_v2_output/

# ---- Cache / temp / system --------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.tmp
*.temp
*~
*.swp
.cache/

# ---- OS / IDE clutter -------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace

# ---- Secrets (just in case — never commit API keys, passwords, paths to DUA-protected mounts)
.env
.env.local
*.key
*.pem
secrets.R
credentials.R

# ---- Allow specific things back in (whitelist exceptions) -------------------
# If you want to share a SMALL example dataset for reproducibility, you can
# un-ignore it explicitly:
# !example_data/tiny_example.csv

# ---- Allow this gitignore itself and README/docs ----------------------------
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.md
